{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fast-paced block puzzle game where strategy, speed, and skill collide. The rules are simple: stack blocks, clear lines, and survive. The challenge goes beyond reflexes \u2014 master the <strong>fluxing mechanics</strong>\u00a0to dominate the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Custom Blocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily customize block skins by adding your own images to the game\u2019s mod folder. No complex setup\u2014just drop your files and play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Campaign:</strong> A roguelite RPG adventure where every cleared stage uncovers new challenges, abilities, and hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hi-Score Mode:</strong> Global leaderboard scoring for 1 or 2 players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Clear lines and match gems to attack the opponent!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/dynamicblock.gif?t=1744622389\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/abilities.gif?t=1744622389\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/lvlup.gif?t=1744622389\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917340/extras/2player.gif?t=1744622389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks that shift and transform, creating a dynamic twist on classic puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique power-ups and game-changing abilities to turn the tide in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden secrets, cryptic developer notes, and a deep world waiting to be uncovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cerebral block-stacking unlike anything you've experienced before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your strategy, push your skills to the limit, and embrace the challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ominoflux</i> is waiting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gem Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/e658ab74ef583631292a01191ab30b70f9f708b7.jpg"},{"name":"Gem Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/0a6000a0fc8b2730c66122fa5b369d22643437a4.jpg"},{"name":"Gem Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/f2a85f103088ef622b28a35388db3050b1086e1a.jpg"},{"name":"Gem Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/f9616c66b3434c64c3d5dbdd0922ccbdfdcd43c6.jpg"},{"name":"Gem Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/ef5097d568a04adb09f694ff77e18fd6de3bbf7c.jpg"},{"name":"Block Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/be6cf920c4ca80e89b068c9fbc745e11b8b74348.jpg"},{"name":" Block Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/2845237be600c8ecf3f771a19367d53e15a60bc5.jpg"},{"name":" Block Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/2a84ff46f5ae75a5659787e837182acd335167b8.jpg"},{"name":" Block Level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/1cd2b74aa307896ce0181bf19d3645cea0b571ed.jpg"},{"name":" Block Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2917340/8bbf2493210d45069e2b83eaf781b99d3fa3cd